    <!-- ============================================================
         R07.012 - FC Lifting Report - converted from Crystal Reports.
         Format: JasperReports 7.0.3 COMPACT format (element kind=...) -
         confirmed live via Maven-resolved net.sf.jasperreports:jasperreports:7.0.3
         that this is the format this engine build actually loads;
         the "standard" xmlns format failed to load even a trivial file.
         Data source: local sandbox TV_FC_LIFTING_REPORT.
         See workstreams/crystal-to-jasper-conversion/R07.012/visual_spec.md.
         ============================================================ -->

